   "notes": "Room-temperature MgSiO3 tetragonal-garnet BM3 with the measured one-bar V0=1513.1 A^3 and K0'=4 assumed. The fit gives K0=161.2 GPa. The paper prints no fit error or covariance for V0 or K0, so the migrated +/-4 GPa value is removed rather than inferred from the separate composition-regression uncertainties. The diffraction structure in this file is an independent 1518.5 A^3 cell.",
